<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/math/statistics/inference/pVal0047> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/hasDimension> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/dimensionless> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/math/statistics/inference/pVal040> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/hasDimension> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/dimensionless> .
